[
  {
    "key": "47gkh2",
    "text": "and",
    "chars": 3,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 NumberTown"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "qk5ggc",
    "text": "group",
    "chars": 5,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 SliceShop"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "y3n91t",
    "text": "Here they come.",
    "chars": 15,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 StoryTime"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "4hn9zd",
    "text": "How many in all?",
    "chars": 16,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 MarketDay"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "1dbpa9",
    "text": "Yes! Let\u2019s count.",
    "chars": 17,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 StoryTime"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "arbabi",
    "text": "Watch me build it!",
    "chars": 18,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 NumberTown"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "1mjvhhv",
    "text": "And here are theirs.",
    "chars": 20,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 StoryTime"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "1df9mad",
    "text": "Let\u2019s count them all!",
    "chars": 21,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 StoryTime"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "7ed9vn",
    "text": "Yes! Let\u2019s skip-count.",
    "chars": 22,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 MarketDay"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "oiope4",
    "text": "Not quite \u2014 try again!",
    "chars": 22,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 ShapeStudio"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "15o87b4",
    "text": "Here comes another one!",
    "chars": 23,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 StoryTime"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "1j98tgo",
    "text": "There goes another one.",
    "chars": 23,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 StoryTime"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "1p26h2x",
    "text": "Let\u2019s count what\u2019s left!",
    "chars": 24,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 StoryTime"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "ln3u4t",
    "text": "Milo has more! How many more?",
    "chars": 29,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 StoryTime"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "1ghxlsi",
    "text": "Count the rods, then the ones.",
    "chars": 30,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 BlockYard"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "153szpm",
    "text": "On the three it is quarter past.",
    "chars": 32,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 TickTock"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "b52a75",
    "text": "Milo has these blocks in the yard.",
    "chars": 34,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 BlockYard"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "w0j4qp",
    "text": "Long hand on the six is half past.",
    "chars": 34,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 TickTock"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "9oc53k",
    "text": "So Milo cuts again. One piece for Bunny\u2026",
    "chars": 40,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 SliceShop"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "1c0d3zv",
    "text": "Oh no \u2014 they keep moving. I've lost count!",
    "chars": 42,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 HopAlong"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "15a24nu",
    "text": "The ones go first \u2014 and he runs out of them.",
    "chars": 44,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 BlockYard"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "l4ha00",
    "text": "Four, five, six\u2026 all the way round to twelve.",
    "chars": 45,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 TickTock"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "1du22bb",
    "text": "Now he can finish the ones, and send the rods.",
    "chars": 46,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 BlockYard"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "cticou",
    "text": "Milo has these blocks, and an order to send out.",
    "chars": 48,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 BlockYard"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "1y0hwjf",
    "text": "Not quite \u2014 listen to the story again, then try!",
    "chars": 48,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 StoryTime"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "1og54wz",
    "text": "Look again \u2014 which side is bigger? Try once more!",
    "chars": 49,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 SeesawPark"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "ocld1",
    "text": "So the long hand does not say six. It says thirty.",
    "chars": 50,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 TickTock"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "qngkcp",
    "text": "Ten ones make ONE rod. Milo walks it up to the row.",
    "chars": 51,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 BlockYard"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "ae7up3",
    "text": "Every clock has two hands, and they are not the same.",
    "chars": 53,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 TickTock"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "gpym9j",
    "text": "That is ten ones on the ground, and some still waiting.",
    "chars": 55,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 BlockYard"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "1sqroh4",
    "text": "That is it \u2014 half past three. Now you can read a clock.",
    "chars": 55,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 TickTock"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "103x35o",
    "text": "Four friends, four equal pieces. Each one gets a QUARTER.",
    "chars": 57,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 SliceShop"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "gtjpv3",
    "text": "So he fetches a rod back and breaks it open into ten ones.",
    "chars": 58,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 BlockYard"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "1sk3rt9",
    "text": "They each get ONE HALF. Nobody got more than anybody else.",
    "chars": 58,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 SliceShop"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "zxdtaj",
    "text": "This short fat one is the HOUR hand. It tells you the hour.",
    "chars": 59,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 TickTock"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "n23yna",
    "text": "Now the waiting ones come in. Count the rods, then the ones.",
    "chars": 60,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 BlockYard"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "15kb4he",
    "text": "The same six that means six hours ALSO means thirty minutes.",
    "chars": 60,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 TickTock"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "11g5vz1",
    "text": "This long thin one is the MINUTE hand. It counts the minutes.",
    "chars": 61,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 TickTock"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "pvwpm",
    "text": "More arrive \u2014 the rods join the row, the ones go on the ground.",
    "chars": 63,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 BlockYard"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "1b819cm",
    "text": "Your turn. Put the long hand on the six to make half past three.",
    "chars": 64,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 TickTock"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "1wmlb0r",
    "text": "Now watch. TWO more friends come along \u2014 that is four friends now.",
    "chars": 66,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 SliceShop"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "2ykwbn",
    "text": "Now the secret. This clock has another set of numbers hiding on it.",
    "chars": 67,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 TickTock"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "qxdv4f",
    "text": "When the long hand points straight up at the twelve, we say o'clock.",
    "chars": 68,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 TickTock"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "1g5xhsy",
    "text": "Bunny and Duck both want some pizza. Just two friends, and one pizza.",
    "chars": 69,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 SliceShop"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "xt5fb6",
    "text": "That is it \u2014 three equal pieces. Thirds! Now you can find a fraction.",
    "chars": 69,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 SliceShop"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "1ajk5qn",
    "text": "Two friends share into halves. Three into thirds. Four into quarters.",
    "chars": 69,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 SliceShop"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "1hbxuz4",
    "text": "and one for Duck, exactly the same size. Two friends, two equal pieces.",
    "chars": 71,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 SliceShop"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "h6bbrm",
    "text": "Same pizza. But Milo has to cut it into four pieces so everyone gets one.",
    "chars": 73,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 SliceShop"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "jvrboh",
    "text": "On the nine we count the other way \u2014 quarter TO, and we say the NEXT hour.",
    "chars": 74,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 TickTock"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "9cwljl",
    "text": "Your turn. THREE friends are waiting \u2014 fill the pizza so everybody gets one.",
    "chars": 76,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 SliceShop"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "157efb3",
    "text": "That is not fair, and it is not a half. A half means both pieces are the SAME.",
    "chars": 78,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 SliceShop"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "7gw9r6",
    "text": "Same digits, different sides, a different number. That is what the places mean.",
    "chars": 79,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 BuildingBlocks"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "1lmm8r7",
    "text": "The short hand tells us which one. Look \u2014 one o'clock, two o'clock, three o'clock.",
    "chars": 82,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 TickTock"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "z7ntgw",
    "text": "More friends means a SMALLER piece each. That is why a quarter is smaller than a half.",
    "chars": 86,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 SliceShop"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "1q788hy",
    "text": "Milo cut it into two pieces \u2014 but look. Bunny got a BIG piece and Duck got a little one.",
    "chars": 88,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 SliceShop"
    ]
  },
  {
    "key": "185dp68",
    "text": "They go up in fives all the way round \u2014 five, ten, fifteen, twenty, twenty-five, thirty.",
    "chars": 88,
    "kind": "teach",
    "sources": [
      "6-8 TickTock"
    ]
  }
]